  tag: 0
  question: "\u1EDE ch\xEDnh gi\u1EEFa m\u1EB7t tr\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3ng \u0110\xF4ng
    S\u01A1n l\xE0 h\xECnh g\xEC?"
  options:
  - "Ng\xF4i sao nhi\u1EC1u c\xE1nh, th\u01B0\u1EDDng hi\u1EC3u l\xE0 m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi"
  - "Con r\u1ED3ng"
  - "B\xF4ng sen"
  - "B\u1EA3n \u0111\u1ED3 \u0111\u1EA5t n\u01B0\u1EDBc"
  correctIndex: 0
  explanation: "Gi\u1EEFa m\u1EB7t tr\u1ED1ng l\xE0 ng\xF4i sao nhi\u1EC1u c\xE1nh,
    th\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c hi\u1EC3u l\xE0 h\xECnh m\u1EB7t tr\u1EDDi."
  relatedLore: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a83df9a73a6e9af43b9d6050b5a3a63f, type: 2}
  sourceRef: "SGK L\u1ECBch s\u1EED v\xE0 \u0110\u1ECBa l\xED 6 (ph\u1EA7n V\u0103n
    Lang \u2013 \xC2u L\u1EA1c); B\u1EA3o t\xE0ng L\u1ECBch s\u1EED Qu\u1ED1c gia:
